@@ -4,6 +4,17 @@ All notable changes to the `nmrs` crate will be documented in this file.

 ## [Unreleased]

+### Added
+
+- Optional desktop-owned `SecretStore` persistence with original NM payloads,
+  bounded completion before SaveSecrets/DeleteSecrets success, and redacted errors.
+- VPN request metadata exposes per-secret NM flags for safe keyring lookup.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Authenticate all secret-agent methods against the current NetworkManager D-Bus
+  owner before forwarding requests or allowing credential-store access.
+
